factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  Headline and reel_script say the offering was Rs 62.10 lakh, but the article's headline says Rs 61.10 lakh and its body says Rs 62.10 lakh; the figure is inconsistent with the article's headline, and the amount the body states as Rs 62 lakh 10 thousand 573 is 62.10 lakh, so the draft's headline figure should be checked against the article's own conflicting headline.
  The reel_script says the count took place 'காலை 10 மணி முதல் இரவு 9 மணி வரை', which matches the article, but the reel_script says the 13 hundis of the four temples were opened on the 3rd; the article says the 13 hundis were opened on 'கடந்த 3ம் தேதி' only in the context of the four temples, so this is consistent; no problem here.
  The reel_script states the hundis are opened every 3 months, which the article supports; however the reel_script says the count was done 'ஜூன் 25ஆம் தேதிக்குப் பின்' which is accurate; the slides_spec line 'ஜூன் 25க்கு பின் கடந்த 3ஆம் தேதி' is consistent.
  The slides_spec and caption omit that the count was held in the presence of the assistant commissioners in the same sense as the article; the caption adds 'எண்ணும் பணி' while the article specifies 'பணி', which is acceptable.
  The reel_script says 'திருச்செங்கோடு கே எஸ் ஆர் கல்லூரி மாணவர்களும் பக்தர்களும்' attributing participation to students and devotees, while the article says 'மாணவ, மாணவியர்' (both male and female students); the draft's 'மாணவர்கள்' omits the female students, a minor distortion.
